cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "heic-rs"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Rust HEIC/HEIF image decoder with no C dependencies. It parses the ISOBMFF container,
  resolves items and item properties, derives grid images by compositing tiles, applies rotation and
  mirror transforms, extracts EXIF and ICC metadata, and converts YUV to RGB. The crate forbids
  unsafe code, has no required dependencies, and its core is no_std plus alloc so it builds for
  wasm32-unknown-unknown. As of version 0.1.0 the container half is complete and the HEVC
  still-picture decoder is not yet linked in, so probe() is fully functional while decode() returns
  an Unsupported error at the codec seam.
authors:
